    {
      "id": "review-6f7111e5fc25-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "[P1] Terminal history permanently blocks a fresh batch after topology drift. Both plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-unattended-batch.ts:192-198 and plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:885-891 apply the old topology binding to findSettledBatchRecord(), including superseded records. Consequently, retiring a drifted batch does not restore the ability to authorize its replacement. Restrict old-topology enforcement to continuation and integration under that authorization; when terminal history no longer matches, skip its integration/completion replay and allow the existing fresh-plan/native-confirmation path. Add a regression for actual observation.tasks drift followed by retirement and a fresh default-one-Lane start on both Hosts.",
      "anchor": "sha256:f08edcd780d1efb7fa127d4dead3dd4b1c2d613bd941e1e83e20ea95a5444d98",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "A running v2 batch records topology A → the trusted Parent plan adds a child or changes a dependency to topology B → resume correctly refuses → retire_stale_batch changes the record to superseded → a fresh explicit start_unattended_batch call without max_parallel retrieves that same terminal record and rejects with plan_changed before native confirmation. The replacement batch can never start, despite retirement having ended the old authorization.",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-unattended-batch.ts:executePreparedPiBatch",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_preflight.ts:findSettledBatchRecord",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_preflight.ts:readConfirmedBatchTopology"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "AC1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "review-829221eeaf93-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 3,
      "summary": "活动的 needs_human 批次绕过 topology 校验，可能返回旧批次的 completed 报告。plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-unattended-batch.ts:194-206 和 plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:887-899 新增的状态过滤只校验 running/completed，却仍调用 completedParentReport。应在历史完成报告查询前校验所有活动 v2 批次，包括 needs_human；仅对 integration 保留状态过滤，并为两个 Host 增加含历史 completed 记录的 parked-batch topology drift 回归测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:25fd485090bba2786de25926cafe9b87ff1d87381c721c2105f68d3e9aa09d6e",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "已完成批次 A 在 Parent tip H 留有通过的 final verification 和任务 t1 的 terminal evidence；用户将 coordinator 更新到 H，并为新增 t2 启动批次 B，B 在尚未推进 Parent tip 时因 t2 失败停为 needs_human。随后 carrier 移除 t2，再调用任一 Host 的 start_unattended_batch → integrationBatch 选择活动 B，但新的 running/completed 过滤跳过 B 的 topology 校验，replayCompleted 仍为 true；completedParentReport 查询历史 A，而 observeParentCompletion 对当前仅含 t1 的图及同一 H 返回 complete，导致 Host 返回 A 的 completed 报告并可执行 tracker synchronization，而不是拒绝 B 的 plan_changed。此为同一“验证完整 confirmed topology 后才能产生 Parent 效果或完成结果”不变量的覆盖缺口：此前修复覆盖 running 活动记录，本轮状态过滤使 needs_human 活动记录不再受保护。读取未修改的 plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts 是因为 completedParentReport 直接调用其中 observeParentCompletion，必须核实其历史 final proof 和 Parent tip 选择行为。",
